    "segments": [
      {
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 2.0,
        "text": "Did you know if you soak one cup of red lentils"
      },
      {
        "start": 2.0,
        "end": 4.32,
        "text": "in water for three hours, add a pinch of salt"
      },
      {
        "start": 4.32,
        "end": 5.4,
        "text": "and blend them smooth."
      },
      {
        "start": 5.4,
        "end": 7.2,
        "text": "Pour a ladle into a hot skillet"
      },
      {
        "start": 7.2,
        "end": 9.16,
        "text": "and cook for two minutes on each side"
      },
      {
        "start": 9.16,
        "end": 11.96,
        "text": "and you end up with soft wraps that fold like a tortilla,"
      },
      {
        "start": 11.96,
        "end": 15.48,
        "text": "made from one ingredient, zero flour, zero eggs, zero dairy."
      },
      {
        "start": 15.48,
        "end": 16.96,
        "text": "Lentils are packed with fiber."
      },
      {
        "start": 16.96,
        "end": 19.16,
        "text": "That feeds the good bacteria in your gut"
      },
      {
        "start": 19.16,
        "end": 20.92,
        "text": "and they carry enough plant protein"
      },
      {
        "start": 20.92,
        "end": 22.68,
        "text": "to keep you full for hours."
      },
      {
        "start": 22.68,
        "end": 24.8,
        "text": "Without the blood sugar crash you get from bread."
      },
      {
        "start": 24.8,
        "end": 26.8,
        "text": "I share real recipes to boost your health,"
      },
      {
        "start": 26.8,
        "end": 29.24,
        "text": "help with bloating, brain fog, immunity"
      },
      {
        "start": 29.28,
        "end": 30.36,
        "text": "and just feel better."
      },
      {
        "start": 30.36,
        "end": 32.16,
        "text": "Comment yes if you want more like this"
      },
      {
        "start": 32.16,
        "end": 34.4,
        "text": "and follow me so you don't miss the next one."
      }
    ],
    "text": "Did you know if you soak one cup of red lentils in water for three hours, add a pinch of salt and blend them smooth. Pour a ladle into a hot skillet and cook for two minutes on each side and you end up with soft wraps that fold like a tortilla, made from one ingredient, zero flour, zero eggs, zero dairy. Lentils are packed with fiber. That feeds the good bacteria in your gut and they carry enough plant protein to keep you full for hours. Without the blood sugar crash you get from bread. I share real recipes to boost your health, help with bloating, brain fog, immunity and just feel better. Comment yes if you want more like this and follow me so you don't miss the next one."
  },
